{"id":113207,"vol":{"id":18058,"name":"Detective Comics"},"num":"733","name":"NML: Shades of Grey","title":"Detective Comics #733","year":"1999","date":"1999-06-01","store":"1999-04-28","poster":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_medium/0/6060/168580-18058-113207-1-detective-comics.JPG","big":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_large/0/6060/168580-18058-113207-1-detective-comics.JPG","pub":"DC Comics","deck":"","desc":"In an attempt to lure out Batman, GCPD encountered Batgirl instead. Gordon gave her a message to relay to her boss - Batman was not welcome in Blue Boy territory. When post-NML dated food began showing up, Penguin realized he had competition. Batman rescued an infant from two women quarreling over guardianship of it. Batgirl gave him Gordon's message; Alfred told him a story about his father. Batman took the child back to the two women and made them promise to both take care of it.","people":[{"id":48783,"name":"Bob Gale","role":"writer"},{"id":40861,"name":"Dennis O'Neil","role":"editor"},{"id":27292,"name":"Ellie De Ville","role":"letterer"},{"id":45110,"name":"Jordan B. Gorfinkel","role":"editor"},{"id":51970,"name":"Joseph Illidge","role":"editor"},{"id":5315,"name":"Pamela Rambo","role":"colorist"},{"id":5357,"name":"Phil Winslade","role":"penciler, inker, cover"},{"id":12717,"name":"Sal Buscema","role":"inker"},{"id":4278,"name":"Wildstorm FX","role":"colorist"}],"chars":[{"id":1699,"name":"Batman","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/11144/111442876/8759934-jrjrhr.jpg"},{"id":5556,"name":"Alfred Pennyworth","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/12/124259/8057339-e2lokwbxsaazhqn.jpg"},{"id":3727,"name":"James Gordon","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/12/124259/8294418-ezgif-6-5bfbe71c77.jpg"}],"arcs":[{"id":42106,"name":"\"Batman\" No Man's Land"}]}